Create a file named `README.md` in the main project folder and paste this inside:

# 🚗 Cars Hub

Cars Hub is a responsive automotive website created for people who see cars as more than simple machines. The project celebrates automotive history, design, engineering, and performance—especially legendary German and Japanese vehicles.

## 🌐 About the Project

This project was developed to practise front-end development using HTML and CSS. It includes an automotive introduction, vehicle cards, social-media links, an embedded YouTube video, and a responsive layout for desktop and mobile devices.

## ✨ Features

* Responsive design for desktop and mobile
* Automotive-themed interface
* Custom black, gold, red, and white colour palette
* Navigation menu
* WhatsApp contact button
* Social-media links
* Vehicle information cards
* Hover effects and animations
* Embedded YouTube video
* Custom logo and favicon
* Additional page for unavailable content

## 🛠️ Technologies

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript
* CSS Flexbox
* CSS Grid
* Media queries
* Font Awesome
* Google Fonts
* YouTube Embed

## 📁 Project Structure

